# Title: Tales of Hearts R (JP)
# ID: PCSG00125
# Edit the value on any line that has a comment (here or in VitaCheat), then activate the cheat.
#
# DIFFICULTY MULTIPLIERS (the game's own table): one cheat, values editable in this file (last column of the
#   lines with a comment). One line per stat and difficulty (Easy, Normal, Hard, Maniac, Unknown).
#   Multipliers are 32-bit floats: 0.5=3F000000 0.75=3F400000 0.8=3F4CCCCD 1.0=3F800000
#   1.1=3F8CCCCD 1.2=3F99999A 1.5=3FC00000 2.0=40000000 2.5=40200000 3.0=40400000
#   4.0=40800000 5.0=40A00000 10.0=41200000
#   Level bonus = whole levels added to every enemy (hex, 16-bit: 000A = 10, 0014 = 20, 0028 = 40).
#   All values below are the game's defaults.
#
# GUARD COUNTER WARNING VOLUME: the sound of an enemy glowing red is played louder.
#   Edit the last two digits of the marked line: 01 normal, 02 2x (default), 04 4x, 08 8x, 10 16x.
#   The game caps a sound at twice its full volume: at the maximum SE volume setting, 4x+ sounds like 2x.

_V0 Difficulty multipliers
$0100 81285A1C 00000000 # Level bonus - Easy +0 levels
$0100 81285A44 00000000 # Level bonus - Normal +0 levels
$0100 81285A6C 0000000A # Level bonus - Hard +10 levels
$0100 81285A94 00000014 # Level bonus - Maniac +20 levels
$0100 81285ABC 00000028 # Level bonus - Unknown +40 levels
